# graphify: ignore the raw graph + scratch, but SHARE the report
#   (dir pattern must be /* — git cannot un-ignore inside an ignored dir)
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

# Ralph runner output (the kit's json, prompts and acceptance gate stay tracked)
scripts/ralph/logs/
scripts/ralph/state/
scripts/ralph/night-report-*
